WEBVTT

00:00:03.219 --> 00:00:07.053
Add a Voice calls entry point under Inbound entry points.

00:00:07.053 --> 00:00:10.278
Give it a Name, and pick the number it answers.

00:00:10.278 --> 00:00:14.599
A number is answered by one enabled entry point for each channel.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.136
Set Route to a queue, and pick Sales.

00:00:19.136 --> 00:00:24.322
Pick the business hours calendar, and the closed action, such as voicemail.

00:00:29.575 --> 00:00:33.890
Write the welcome message callers hear, and the closed message.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.016
Choose where voicemail goes.

00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:41.707
A keypad menu can be built in the same form, when callers should choose a department.

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:42.395
Save.

